<title>EGYPT: Amriyah Cement results at end-Q3 1996/7.</title>
<headline>Amriyah Cement results at end-Q3 1996/7.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>Net sales			   287,937,856</p>
<p>Production costs		  161,801,093</p>
<p>Overheads			    13,722,768</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		19,509,862</p>
<p>Exceptional expenses		2,670,187</p>
<p>Net profit before tax	   129,253,670</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
